sequenceDiagram
    actor Staff as "Admin/Operator"
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant Service as "deliveryService: Service"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    Staff->>UI: Open dispatched shipment
    UI->>+API: GET /api/v1/deliveries/orders/{orderId}
    API->>Service: getAssignableShipment()
    Service->>+DB: Read shipment and active driver/vehicle resources
    DB-->>-Service: Available resources
    Service-->>UI: Delivery assignment options
    Staff->>UI: Select driver and vehicle
    UI->>+API: PATCH /api/v1/shipments/{id}/assignment
    API->>Service: assignShipment(driver, vehicle)
    Service->>DB: Validate same-warehouse resource and save assignment snapshot
    API-->>-UI: Assignment saved
    Note over Service,DB: No driver application route optimization or live GPS tracking is assumed


